From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Martin Lund <mrlund@hotmail.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 13:09:58 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 52/66] arm64: dts: qcom: sm8750-oneplus-dodge: trial: limit
 pcie0 to one lane

The working 6.16 boot trains the WCN7860 link at Gen3 x1; 7.3 trains
Gen3 x2 and MHI never completes BHI (no endpoint MSIs). Try x1 to match.
Local trial commit.
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8750-oneplus-dodge.dts | 7 +++++++
 1 file changed, 7 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8750-oneplus-dodge.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8750-oneplus-dodge.dts
index db2103900..641533267 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8750-oneplus-dodge.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8750-oneplus-dodge.dts
@@ -1092,6 +1092,13 @@ &pon_resin {
 };
 
 &pcie0 {
+	/*
+	 * Trial: the vendor/6.16 bring-up trains the WCN7860 link at x1
+	 * (LnkSta "Width x1 (downgraded)") and works; 7.3 trains x2 and the
+	 * device never completes BHI. Limit to one lane to match.
+	 */
+	num-lanes = <1>;
+
 	wake-gpios = <&tlmm 104 GPIO_ACTIVE_HIGH>;
 	perst-gpios = <&tlmm 102 GPIO_ACTIVE_LOW>;
 
